1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,338
Every PHP program that uses a database follows the same five steps.

2
00:00:05,338 --> 00:00:10,026
Connect, with the host, user, password and database name.

3
00:00:10,026 --> 00:00:11,354
Check the connection.

4
00:00:11,354 --> 00:00:12,421
Send a query.

5
00:00:12,421 --> 00:00:18,671
Fetch the rows, usually in a while loop, because fetch returns false when the rows run out.

6
00:00:18,671 --> 00:00:20,260
And close the connection.

